giver lines: ["n_hero: Esmer shuttle parts, stencilled \"SHUTTLE YARD, return to Ilo\". Some have been here a while.","n_baldino: Ilo lends me parts. I lend her opinions. She calls it a fair trade. She's being polite."]
look fan: {"r":"used","tgt":"wlook","label":"p_look"}
look fan lines: ["n_hero: A fan with three blades: brass, wood and a bit of tin. One from each repair.","n_baldino: It cools the tests. And me."]
look pulse: {"r":"used","tgt":"wlook","label":"p_look"}
look pulse lines: ["n_hero: A box with a brass horn, labelled \"THUNDER BOX\". Every so often it stops the toy mill beside it. For three seconds.","n_baldino: Then it needs ten to get its breath back. Not ready. One day it'll stop a real mill."]
look kettle: {"r":"used","tgt":"wlook","label":"p_look"}
look kettle lines: ["n_hero: A kettle wired to a coupler, black with soot. The lid is stuck in the ceiling.","n_hero: A note on the wall: \"TEA: BY HAND.\"","n_baldino: It boiled dry. Couplers hate dry. The lid went up at the third bell. The tea went everywhere else."]
look crate: {"r":"used","tgt":"wlook","label":"p_look"}
look crate lines: ["n_hero: Esmer shuttle parts, stencilled \"SHUTTLE YARD, return to Ilo\". Some have been here a while.","n_baldino: Ilo lends me parts. I lend her opinions. She calls it a fair trade. She's being polite."]
talk 1: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":false,"lines":["n_baldino: Twinsen! At last! Mind the... ah. Never mind, I have another one.","n_hero: Baldino, Vesk says the project brings heat and light. What is it really doing?","n_baldino: Look at the globe. Our planet sits inside a shell, like a nut. Beneath the shell sleeps the being Sendell watches over.","n_baldino: Vesk is drilling through the shell. He believes the being is waking and nothing can stop it, so he's saving whoever he can. The rest... he isn't.","n_hero: Then we stop the drill.","n_baldino: No, no, no! Stop it halfway and the shell cracks on its own. We have to go down there and reverse it. But first we need to get past the platform's shield.","n_baldino: That's why I built an override key. Well, almost. Two parts are missing: the cog from the top of the old mill, and the code cylinder in the project depot's locker.","n_baldino: The shield draws power from the three mills. Brake them with your ball, and the shield will be weak enough for the key to open it.","n_baldino: One more thing. Nobody on Citadel Island knows any of this. Zoé is waiting at the lighthouse. When the key is ready, she'll broadcast a warning to the whole island."]}
talk 2: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"lines":["n_baldino: While you're here. My test pair, on the long table. Two relays: one talks, the other listens.","n_baldino: Or should. They won't hear each other. Have a look if you like. The lever starts them."]}
talk 3: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":0,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: The hoist is older than Arthur. It lifts everything I build. Mostly back down again."]}
talk 4: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":1,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: Ilo from the shuttle yard draws my housings. I draw the parts that catch fire."]}
talk 5: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":2,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: That fan has had five blades. Never more than three at a time."]}
talk 6: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":3,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: The radio? Seven repairs. It still hums in the wrong key. So do I."]}
talk 7: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":4,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: Esmers knock twice and wait. Years here, and I still forget to answer."]}
talk 8: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":5,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: Oil the hoist, kick the radio, and never trust a quiet coupler."]}
talk 9: {"r":"talked","plan":true,"ask":true,"n":0,"lines":["n_baldino: A cog from the old mill, a code cylinder from the depot. And don't forget the brakes!","n_baldino: The hoist is older than Arthur. It lifts everything I build. Mostly back down again."]}
